'''Eternal II''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was released on November 17th, 2018 to promote [[Murder Mystery 2|Murder Mystery 2’s]] merch. It was originally obtainable by purchasing merch from [https://shopmm2.com shopmm2.com]<ref>https://twitter.com/NikilisRBX/status/1063936144533057536</ref> and redeeming the promotional code that came with it. It is now only obtainable through trading as the merch has since sold out.

== Appearance ==
The guard is silver with curved quillons, two sets of horns by the ricasso, and glowing turquoise eyes. The handle, attached to a silver prong below the guard, is gray with a silver paracord wrap that has glowing turquoise beads on it.

==Trivia==
*It has a predecessor that was obtained in a similar way, that being [[Eternal]]. However, it also has three following successors, those being [[Eternal III]], [[Eternal IV]], and as well as the Christmas version [[Eternalcane]].
*It has been a major target in duping.
*It is the least valuable out of all Eternals.
*Like all the other Eternal knives, its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/532254782/Sword-of-the-Eternal-Abyss Sword of the Eternal Abyss].

